      "desc": "Sporting a neat crew-cut and wearing a white chef's uniform; parodies internet celebrity chef Wang Gang with his signature opening: \"Hello everyone, I am Chef Wang. In this video, I will share a home-cooked dish with you: Egg Pancake.\" Demonstrates brisk, professional culinary skills."
