      "zh": "祛避老祖",
      "sex": "Male (he/him)",
      "titles": "Patriarch Qubi (祛避老祖)",
      "role": "Thousand Beasts Hall (万兽堂) — First-Generation Founding Ancestor (历代第一代掌门)",
      "desc": "Visionary and ruthless ancient founder who slew a terrifying ancient ferocious beast with the aid of a True Immortal and brought back its Beast Soul, establishing Thousand Beasts Hall's bloody trial where successive sect leader candidates risked death to devour portions of the soul to reach Tribulation Transcendence."
