      "desc": "Gruff, rotund, calculating, and candid veteran merchant powerhouse; sports a round belly and suffers from old internal injuries; numb to the world's cruelties after millennia in the harsh Central Domain; deeply regrets failing to recruit young Zhou Hui into the Abyssal Ocean Society after seeing Qianxing Hall's booming tourism economy."
