      "desc": "Patient, dutiful, and pragmatic. While he fits the outside world's stereotype of a muscular, aggressive body-cultivator meathead, he actually acts as the public diplomatic face of Blood Demon Hall to shield its overwhelmingly female disciple population from bizarre rumors and slander. Flew back 28 shichen without pause to deliver and plant the Black Coral tree in the sect courtyard, and calmly guides his impulsive master and eager junior sisters through the Abyss Sea transit system."
