      "desc": "Observant and practical on the surface, but deeply susceptible to foodie temptations; sips Caramel Milk Tea in pure bliss; terrified of Senior Brother Bai's scolding after checking their emptied storage pouch; proposes checking the auction catalog before leaving (a fateful idea she regrets for the rest of her life); boldly calls out Master's nonexistent private savings."
