      "titles": "Fourteenth Lady Mei (十四娘)",
      "role": "Longmen Town (龙门镇) — Fourteenth Daughter of Mayor Mei Xianyu",
      "desc": "Naive, sheltered, and foolishly innocent; blurted out \"Dad, since when do we have a Grand-Aunt?\" in front of the undercover Carefree Palace operative before being hypnotized."
