      "desc": "The largest flagship auction event hosted by the Palace of Carefree Wandering (逍遥宫), where top-tier treasures, artifacts, and living cultivators as \"furnaces\" were auctioned to high-level figures. Shattered and cleaved in half with heavenly lightning by Zhou Hui upon reaching Tribulation Transcendence to avenge human decency and settle his youthful grievance."
